    "detailed_description": "Arcaxer is a turn-based VR RPG set in a virtual world besieged by violent entities. Take monsters face-to-face with first-person turn-based combat, while exploring the unusual world of Arcaxer in a 3rd-person god-like view.<br><br>See how far you can make it into the Stack, a tower which creates an endless number of randomly-generated dungeons to explore. Make it far enough in, and you might just end up taking on the elusive, and dangerous, Task Master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/d2486e210ea1c81ee901391b0f887721.poster.avif?t=1665606799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/d2486e210ea1c81ee901391b0f887721.webm?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/d2486e210ea1c81ee901391b0f887721.mp4?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>TURN-BASED COMBAT IN VIRTUAL REALITY!</strong><br><br>Experience intense battles in first-person as you weave in and out of enemy attacks and physically utilise the abilities and attacks in your arsenal. It\u2019s just like turn-based games when you were a kid, except now you\u2019re in the midst of it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/e9996691fb6175449055589319a168f7.poster.avif?t=1665606799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/e9996691fb6175449055589319a168f7.webm?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/e9996691fb6175449055589319a168f7.mp4?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>EXPLORE A HUGE VR WORLD</strong><br><br>Discover a world teeming with friends and foes alike during a 20+ hour campaign. Learn about the hostile force known as the Toxin, chase down the elusive \u2018Task Master\u2019 and meet a unique cast of characters along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/eeb8f97b92541190f16827fb769f221d.poster.avif?t=1665606799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/eeb8f97b92541190f16827fb769f221d.webm?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/eeb8f97b92541190f16827fb769f221d.mp4?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>UNIQUE PLAYER CLASSES</strong><br><br>Choose between five classic RPG-inspired character classes, each with a unique playstyle reimagined for an absolutely out-of-this-world and intensely-immersive VR experience.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fighter - Deliver damaging physical attacks with your own body <br></li><li>Mage - Utilise Hax, Arcaxer\u2019s equivalent to magic, to deal damage from afar<br></li><li>Thief - Make use of unique wildcard abilities to turn the tide of fights<br></li><li>Blue Mage - Claim the powerful abilities of monsters as your own<br></li><li>Dark Knight - Borrows random abilities from other classes, always exciting!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/7e3a8726c6d05f777e7ab1e76a33fa1a.poster.avif?t=1665606799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/7e3a8726c6d05f777e7ab1e76a33fa1a.webm?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/7e3a8726c6d05f777e7ab1e76a33fa1a.mp4?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED DUNGEONS TO EXPLORE AND CONQUER</strong><br><br>Explore The Stack, a never-ending series of procedurally-generated dungeons that grow in challenge the further you explore. Fear not, each journey through The Stack will reward you with new loot and items, making your character even stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/8c1a6d933dc14fcf3e29a2067168c81a.poster.avif?t=1665606799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/8c1a6d933dc14fcf3e29a2067168c81a.webm?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354540/extras/8c1a6d933dc14fcf3e29a2067168c81a.mp4?t=1665606799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>PLAY FUN MINIGAMES</strong><br><br>Fancy a break from the onslaught of enemies? Arcaxer has a number of minigames designed to help you better get to grips with the mechanics. You\u2019ll also earn additional experience for blowing some steam off.",
